Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.20,0:00:03.10,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Magnificent.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N太精彩了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.10,0:00:06.24,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Sealed in style by Paolini.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N帕奥利尼漂亮收官
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.28,0:00:09.50,TL,,0,0,306,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And what has been a season of struggle,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N在这个一路艰难的赛季
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.62,0:00:13.54,TL,,0,0,480,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}a much-needed win for the Italian.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N意大利人拿到急需的一胜
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.89,0:00:15.60,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}帕奥利尼赢下两盘
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.60,0:00:17.87,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}过程却并不轻松
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.89,0:00:22.44,TL,,0,0,306,,{\an2}北京时间{\fs78}10{\fs68}月{\fs78}12{\fs68}日下午 武汉首轮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.44,0:00:25.13,TL,,0,0,306,,{\an2}帕奥利尼迎战贝莱克
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.23,0:00:30.55,TL,,0,0,306,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Lovely. Yeah, that is what Paolini does.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N漂亮 这就是帕奥利尼
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.55,0:00:33.45,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Such a gorgeous touch. Oh!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N手感太细腻了 哦
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.94,0:00:45.74,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh, she dug that out ever so well. Tough one.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N哦 这球救得太好了 不好打
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.66,0:00:50.36,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It's got work to do for it to be in this game.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N还需要努力 才能留在这一局
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.49,0:00:53.02,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}帕奥利尼先冲到{\fs78}4{\fs68}比{\fs78}0{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.02,0:00:55.10,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}贝莱克在底线继续追击
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.10,0:00:57.93,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}把这一盘的悬念又拉了回来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.98,0:01:04.95,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh, it's beautifully struck though. Fighting away here.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这拍打得漂亮 她仍在拼搏
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.84,0:01:37.02,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh, long? No.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N哦 出界了吗？没有
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.18,0:01:40.68,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Well, Bejlek.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N贝莱克这一球
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.22,0:01:54.96,TL,,0,0,306,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}So quick, so athletic and so powerful.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N速度快 身体强 击球有力
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.06,0:02:03.91,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Threatened to come back, and she still might do just that.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她展现反扑势头 仍可能追上
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.91,0:02:06.89,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Third set point. She has to take it.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N第三个盘点 她必须把握住
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.17,0:02:10.37,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Needs the first serve.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她需要一发进球
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.89,0:02:13.38,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}贝莱克把比分追到{\fs78}3{\fs68}比{\fs78}5{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.38,0:02:15.39,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}帕奥利尼终于拿下盘点
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.39,0:02:17.80,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68} 先赢一盘
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.84,0:02:31.58,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}She's done it. Just about did enough there, Paolini.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她做到了 帕奥利尼惊险拿下
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.58,0:02:33.48,TL,,0,0,306,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}That was a struggle at times,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她有时打得很艰难
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.48,0:02:37.62,TL,,0,0,480,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}but the fast start good enough for her when she led four-love.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N四比零的快速开局给了她优势
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.76,0:02:41.40,TL,,0,0,480,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Bejlek showed real resistance from there on in,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N贝莱克此后展现顽强抵抗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.40,0:02:43.68,TL,,0,0,480,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}but Paolini takes it six-three.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N但帕奥利尼六比三拿下
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.89,0:02:45.73,TL,,0,0,306,,{\an2}第二盘换了风向
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.73,0:02:47.97,TL,,0,0,306,,{\an2}贝莱克从底线不断压回球来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.97,0:02:50.90,TL,,0,0,306,,{\an2}帕奥利尼还得重新稳住发球
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.74,0:03:07.30,TL,,0,0,306,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh, wonderful work from Paolini. She's so quick.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N帕奥利尼处理精彩 速度真快
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.94,0:03:14.21,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Big chance now for Bejlek. Paolini's second serve in particular has been brittle.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N贝莱克有机会 帕奥利尼二发脆弱
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.76,0:03:26.76,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Beautifully played, and it's been coming.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N打得漂亮 这一刻早已有了征兆
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.89,0:03:28.80,TL,,0,0,306,,{\an2}贝莱克拿到{\fs78}3{\fs68}比{\fs78}1{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.80,0:03:31.37,TL,,0,0,306,,{\an2}帕奥利尼又面对两次破发点
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.37,0:03:33.39,TL,,0,0,306,,{\an2}这一局必须守住
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.28,0:03:42.24,TL,,0,0,306,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Well, that's better. That's a bit more bite to the forehand from Paolini.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N好多了 帕奥利尼正手更有威力
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.89,0:03:44.64,TL,,0,0,306,,{\an2}帕奥利尼没有退
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.64,0:03:47.72,TL,,0,0,306,,{\an2}她先回破 再救回自己的发球局
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.72,0:03:49.46,TL,,0,0,306,,{\an2}从{\fs78}1{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68}追到{\fs78}3{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.46,0:03:51.48,TL,,0,0,306,,{\an2}反扑还没有结束
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.74,0:04:02.90,TL,,0,0,306,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Well, Bejlek's looking at the line.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N贝莱克在看那条边线
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.00,0:04:16.78,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Well watched. Oh, that's a huge point saved there.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N判断很好 救下这关键一分
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.94,0:04:21.70,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Ten taken. Will this be the eleventh?{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N已拿下十次 这会是第十一次吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.79,0:04:24.35,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fs78}4{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68}又被追回{\fs78}4{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.35,0:04:25.96,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}帕奥利尼再次破发
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.96,0:04:28.80,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}把机会带进自己的发球局
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.94,0:04:33.52,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Paolini then back in front.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N帕奥利尼重新取得领先
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.02,0:04:45.52,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Took too many liberties there, Bejlek.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N贝莱克这一下打得太冒险了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.80,0:05:07.70,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Magnificent.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N太精彩了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.70,0:05:10.84,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Sealed in style by Paolini.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N帕奥利尼漂亮收官
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.88,0:05:14.10,TL,,0,0,306,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And what has been a season of struggle,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N在这个一路艰难的赛季
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.22,0:05:18.14,TL,,0,0,480,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}a much-needed win for the Italian.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N意大利人拿到急需的一胜
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.49,0:05:21.99,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}制胜分 帕奥利尼{\fs78}26{\fs68} 贝莱克{\fs78}17{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.99,0:05:25.66,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}一发得分率 {\fs78}65{\fs68}%对{\fs78}56{\fs68}%
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.66,0:05:26.81,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}武汉这一胜
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.81,0:05:29.91,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}能让帕奥利尼找回节奏吗？
